{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:35b3ff324e96f15b","name":"Gutkurr","source":{"id":"source:reference-35b3ff324e96f15b","title":"Gutkurr","revision":20877,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:41:52Z","sha256":"b4b4c0dde2c100522a43023177e235c3436742678bfbb6d9afc189bbebd51a61","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20877","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gutkurr&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-35b3ff324e96f15b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A vicious beast used by the Separatists in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the Gutkurr is a huge creature with powerful jaws and a thick carapace lined with bony protrusions. Gutkurrs are native to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ryloth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ryloth","referenceId":"reference:ad4130ff69b659fe"},", but for centuries they have been exported by crime lords as pets, much like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jabba the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jabba_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:4f1583c9ec5e6852"}," used a captured ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rancor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rancor","referenceId":"reference:fb68a8b2803a85f7"}," to torment his enemies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Gutkurr is a surprisingly intelligent creature that, while absolutely vicious, maintains a level of cunning exceeding that of other predators. Although driven by their natural predatory instincts, the Gutkurr is intelligent enough to be trained- but only b